		{
			dependencies: ["091DDF084FF0B8B5"]
			description: [
				"Blue Skies adds two dimensions: the frozen, sunlit &bEverbright&f and the warm, twilit &6Everdawn&f."
				""
				"Find a &eGatekeeper's house&f in the Overworld (snowy or mountain biomes are a good bet). Trade with him for a &6Zeal Lighter&f and light the portal in his cellar."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cDimension locks:&f"
				"&bEverbright&f opens once you have obtained &eAncient Debris&f."
				"&6Everdawn&f opens once you have &esummoned the Wither&f."
				""
				"Your vanilla and modded gear is heavily weakened there - you are meant to gear up from the dimension itself."
